# gP lists only projects, and choosing one focuses it in the outline.
file <<END
Work:
	- Hiring plan
	Hiring:
		- Screen resumes
END
keys gP
see Go to Project
type hiring
see Hiring
hide Hiring plan  Work
keys <Enter>
see › Work
hide Go to Project
keys x
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Hiring plan
	Hiring: @done({today})
		- Screen resumes
END
